OL,3,GNEWSATitanic hero's postcard to sister 
OL,4,Asells for #32k                         
OL,6,FHis postcard, which was among the lots 
OL,7,Fat auction on Saturday in Wiltshire,   
OL,8,Freads: "Thanks very much for your      
OL,9,Fletter. Having glorious weather, went  
OL,10,Fto Cowes yesterday. Will write later   
OL,11,Fbefore we sail."                       
